<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Crane half-year net A$13.57 million.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Crane half-year net A$13.57 million.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				     13.57 vs 10.47</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    22.00 vs 20.00</p>
<p>NOTE: G.E. Crane is a metal fabrication group and plumbing materials supplier.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  485.98 vs 443.99</p>
<p>    Other income			   6.06 vs   8.84</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    21.87 vs 15.15</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    36.5 vs 35.1</p>
<p>    Abnormal profit (thousands)	 nil vs 907</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>    Tax					8.31 vs 5.61</p>
<p>    Interest				 3.57 vs 4.60</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   9.44 vs 7.21</p>
<p>    Minorities		    credit 8 vs credit 16</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said 1995 earnings per share figure was adjusted for bonus element in subsequent issues during 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
